                <div class="sub-prices">Eigenes Netz: <b>${sub.pricePerKwhOwn.toFixed(2)} \u20AC/kWh</b> \xB7 Roaming: ${sub.pricePerKwhRoaming.toFixed(2)} \u20AC/kWh</div>
